Al_gas.density.ic.constant.value = 0.0_kg/m^3
Al2O3_gas.density.ic.type = constant
Al2O3_gas.density.ic.constant.value = 0.0_kg/m^3

# Developed GrossModel flame composition sampled from the saved t=0.755 ms
# solution.  The gas and condensed fields remain registered to the saved
# propellant surface, preserving the spatial segregation and nonlinear
# reaction-rate correlations that a horizontal average loses.  The sample is
# particle-free through 0.5 mm, then transitions smoothly to pure Final products
# by 0.8 mm.  Three compact RGBA images use 384 x 480 cell-centered samples and
# two channels per 16-bit value.
# Their six encoded values sum to 65535 at every node, so bilinear interpolation
# preserves a unit mass-fraction sum without losing trace reactants in the
# reaction tail.  The 1 kg/m^3 image scale is only a composition seed; low-Mach
# initialization reconciles its magnitude to the 3 MPa EOS and condensed volume.
